\par\par \b \uc2 Argentina stocks close flat after intraday record  \b0\par\par\uc2 314 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Dezember 2006\par 22:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, Argentina, Dec 6 (Reuters) - Argentine stocks closed steady on Wednesday after a choppy session that saw shares hit a fresh intraday record on strong buying by investment funds, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 The benchmark MerVal index <.MERV> of 13 leading stocks closed down 0.05 percent at 1,976.12 points, after setting an all-time intraday high of 1,985.98 points. On Tuesday, the index notched up a record close of 1,977.16 points.  \par \par \uc2 During the volatile day's trade, MerVal shares gained as much as 0.45 percent and lost as much as 0.58 percent subsequently due to profit-taking.  \par \par \uc2 "We're still in a good moment for trading. The profit-taking takes place during the day and is well-absorbed," said Leopoldo Olivari, a trader at the Bacque brokerage.  \par \par \uc2 Trade volume was a moderate 66.5 million pesos ($21.7 million) -- way down on Tuesday's 137.8 million pesos.  \par \par \uc2 Traders say the market could still hit the 2,000-point mark in the near future.  \par \par \uc2 "Today (steelmaker) Tenaris was the missing factor. If it hadn't been for its fall, we could have reached the 2,000 points," said Juan Diedrich, a trader at the Capital Markets Argentina brokerage.  \par \par \uc2 Tenaris is the MerVal's heaviest-weighted stock and its shares lost 1.27 percent to end at 70.1 pesos per share. Meanwhile investment group Pampa Holding fell 1.12 percent to 1.77 pesos per share.  \par \par \uc2 Grupo Financiero Galicia led the gainers, rising 1.98 percent to 2.58 pesos.  \par \par \uc2 The peso <ARSB=> weakened by just 0.08 percent to 3.0625/3.065 per dollar, but maintained its strongest levels in six months despite regular \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 ARGENTINA\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|U|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020061206e2c6002fw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
