\par\par \b \uc2 Argentine stocks notch fresh record, trade brisk  \b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 November 2006\par 22:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, Argentina, Nov 30 (Reuters) - Argentine stocks rose on Thursday to reach a record high for the second straight session, boosted by a late turn-around in other regional markets, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 The MerVal index <.MERV> of 13 leading stocks rose 0.29 percent to 1,967.02 points, surpassing the previous day's record of 1,961.18 points.  \par \par \uc2 MerVal shares rose 10.4 percent in November and 27.5 percent since the start of the year.  \par \par \uc2 Trade volume was a brisk 86.8 million pesos ($28.1 million) on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 "The main factor in the MerVal's new gains was the change in movement in international markets at the (MerVal's) close," said Antonio Sejuela, an analyst with Puente Hermanos brokerage.  \par \par \uc2 "We continue with a good business climate and all bets are on the MerVal hitting the anxiously awaited 2,000 points," he added.  \par \par \uc2 The session's gains were led by energy holding company Pampa Holding , the shares of which jumped 4.3 percent to 1.69 pesos, and steelmaker Siderar , which gained 2.85 percent to end at 23.45 pesos.  \par \par \uc2 In the region, Mexico's stocks <.MXX> traded up 0.75 percent and the Dow Jones industrial average <.DJI> ended down 0.04 percent, but after having traded significantly lower.  \par \par \uc2 The Argentine peso <ARSB=> firmed 0.16 percent at \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  houses to end at 3.09/3.0925 per U.S. dollar, due to dollar sales by investors, banks and exporters as the month came to a close, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued its regular \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost exports by maintaining a weak peso.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 ARGENTINA\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|U|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020061130e2bu002ez\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
