\par\par \b \uc2 Argentina bourse rises on Tenaris, peso inches down  \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juni 2006\par 00:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, June 23 (Reuters) - Argentine stocks rose on Friday influenced by Tenaris, which manufactures steel pipes for the oil industry and rose due to sustained high oil prices, while the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed slightly weaker.  \par \par \uc2 The Merval index <.MERV> of 11 leading shares rose 0.72 percent to 1,589.12 points.  \par \par \uc2 Tenaris , was the session's biggest percentage gainer, up 2.21 percent to 55.40 pesos per share, followed by telecommunications company Telecom , which gained 1.56 percent to 6.50 pesos per share.  \par \par \uc2 Oil held near $71 a barrel on Friday as U.S. gasoline demand continued to rise despite near-record prices.  \par \par \uc2 "The trend today was due to the volatility on the Dow Jones and the movement of Tenaris, since there wasn't much else on offer," said Hernan Labrone, an analyst with Fenix Financial Company.  \par \par \uc2 The Dow Jones Industrial Average <.DJI> dipped on Friday on concerns the U.S. Federal Reserve will raise short-term interest rates for the 17th time in a row next week.  \par \par \uc2 "It seems the emerging markets have discounted a new rise in the (U.S.) interest rate, but prudence has become the main guide at this time since there aren't big trades that would make one think that the downward trend is over," said Labrone, regarding Argentine stocks.  \par \par \uc2 On the broad market, transactions were worth 78.8 million pesos ($25.4 million), with 34 gainers, 20 losers and 11 issues unchanged.  \par \par \uc2 On the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market the Argentine peso closed 0.16 percent weaker, to end at 3.0975/3.1 per U.S. dollar <ARSB=> as traders stand back expecting more \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 ARGENTINA\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|Table|ABN|D|M|E|RBN|U|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060623e26n00208\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
