c2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reported later Tuesday that it bought $65.5 million and EUR1 million in the open market during the day's session.  \par \par \uc2 "If the peso becomes stronger than 3.06 to the dollar, then I think we can expect the bank to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  more intensively," said Pablo Magnanini, a trader with Banco Galicia.  \par \par \uc2 - By Drew Benson and Kim-Mai Cutler, Dow Jones Newswires; 5411-4311-3127; andrew.benson@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires  \par \par \uc2 02-14-06 1715ET  \par \par \uc2 Dokument OSTDJ00020060214e22e00cll\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
